WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.997 --> 00:00:03.598
AudioSilo on a phone. Home opens on my current book.

2
00:00:03.598 --> 00:00:09.550
Then what else I’m in the middle of, and what’s next in each series.

3
00:00:09.550 --> 00:00:11.561
Tap to pick up where I left off.

4
00:00:11.561 --> 00:00:14.369
This chapter in bars, the whole book underneath.

5
00:00:14.369 --> 00:00:18.431
Jump ahead, with a way back for ten seconds.

6
00:00:18.431 --> 00:00:26.035
Speed and sleep open as sheets.

7
00:00:26.035 --> 00:00:28.119
Who’s who only shows the people I’ve already met.

8
00:00:28.119 --> 00:00:36.065
Reach a new chapter and they appear. Nothing past my place.

9
00:00:36.065 --> 00:00:39.764
The mini player stays with me on every tab.

10
00:00:39.764 --> 00:00:46.531
Up next is my queue, with the rest of the series suggested underneath.

11
00:00:46.531 --> 00:00:54.923
Series are shelves, in reading order.

12
00:00:54.923 --> 00:00:58.324
Books I don’t own yet are ghost spines.

13
00:00:58.324 --> 00:01:06.148
My listening: the week, the streak, and the days I listened.

14
00:01:06.148 --> 00:01:18.666
My year in listening, as a story.

15
00:01:18.666 --> 00:01:23.385
The same app runs on the web, iPhone and iPad.
